---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - SavoFinance">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-40 px-6 mb-32">
    
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        About the Platform
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-950 tracking-tight leading-tight mt-4 mb-6">
        Building an Independent and Structured Financial Future
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-650 leading-relaxed font-normal text-slate-600">
        SavoFinance serves as a space for analysis, education, and an independent provider of financial tools. We believe that smart financial decisions are born from strong literacy and transparent data.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    <div class="prose prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-850 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 tracking-tight">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Bridging the information gap in the financial world by providing in-depth analytical articles, debt management guides, and interactive calculator simulations accessible to everyone with no hidden fees.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 tracking-tight mt-8">Core Values</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4">
        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-sm text-blue-950">Analytical Accuracy</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Every educational article is thoroughly researched to provide an objective perspective for your asset management.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-sm text-blue-950">Open & Private Tools</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Our financial calculators are designed to be instant and private, without storing your sensitive income data on any server.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 tracking-tight mt-8">Total Independence</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        SavoFinance is not affiliated with any specific financial institution or product. The recommendations and calculation formulas presented in our calculators are purely based on global standard financial mathematics formulas to maintain absolute objectivity in assessing your financial health.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>